Package: privacyfox
Version: 0.1.1
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: waterfox
Maintainer: PrivacyFox Project <hello@privacyfox.dev>
Homepage: https://privacyfox.dev
Description: Hardening config layer for Waterfox
 PrivacyFox doesn't touch Waterfox's own code -- it's a config layer
 installed on top of a real, official, unmodified Waterfox install.
 .
 This package installs a policies.json (disables Firefox Accounts/Sync
 nagging and the default-browser check, force-installs a curated set of
 privacy extensions) and provides the privacyfox-apply command, which
 each user runs once to drop a merged Arkenfox + Betterfox hardening
 user.js into their own profile.
 .
 See https://privacyfox.dev and https://github.com/rjc3rd/PrivacyFox for
 full details and credits.
